      <activity id="271d6418-3639-5141-8268-41dc7fd0e2a5" activityNameId="7dd4a9a9-ea3f-5374-9b4d-8c4bc26b5434" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Frit, for CRT tube production, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Frit, for CRT tube production, at plant
Data about the frit composition are taken from literature. All further parts (energy, infrastructure, transport) is estimated, based on other datasets and/or the quality guidelines of the ecoinvent database.;
UUID: 06cce798-ea7c-348b-aea4-7bca75daefb5
This module includes the material and energy efforts for the production of frit used in the CRT tube production. Estimations for infrastructure and transport of the raw materials are included as well. Emissions to air and water as well as waste are not taken into account.
Location: Literature data are used to establish a global valuable dataset
Technology: current composition of CRT frit, according to literature
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_06cce798-ea7c-348b-aea4-7bca75daefb5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
